OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786952876
OL,3,CMan, 18, arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Cdangerous driving after fatal car crash
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fon suspicion of dangerous driving
OL,8,Ffollowing a fatal car crash involving
OL,9,Fanother teenager in Yateley.
OL,11,FHampshire Police were called to
OL,12,Freports of a single-vehicle collision
OL,13,Fon Cricket Hill Lane on Saturday
OL,14,Fevening.
OL,16,FAn 18-year-old man, from Fleet, was
OL,17,Ftaken with serious injuries to
OL,18,Fhospital, where he later died.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
