OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786952876
OL,3,CMan, 18, arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Cdangerous driving after fatal car crash
OL,6,FAnother 18-year-old man suffered
OL,7,Fserious, but not life-threatening,
OL,8,Finjuries, whilst two others were
OL,9,Ftreated for minor injuries.
OL,11,FThe force is now appealing for anyone
OL,12,Fwho witnessed the incident to come
OL,13,Fforward.
OL,15,FDetective Sergeant Edward Crofts, of
OL,16,Fthe Serious Collision Investigation
OL,17,FUnit, said: "We would particularly
OL,18,Flike to hear from anyone with relevant
OL,19,Fdash cam or CCTV footage, if you have
OL,20,Fnot already spoken to us.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
