OL,3,CMan, 18, arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Cdangerous driving after fatal car crash
OL,6,F"Our thoughts remain with those
OL,7,Faffected by this incident, and
OL,8,Fspecialist officers will be supporting
OL,9,Fthe family of the 18-year-old man who
OL,10,Fpassed away."
